# game/story/chapter3.rpy:20
translate indonesian chapter3_start_fcd172a8:

    # narrator "At dawn, Vespera unlocks an overgrown Rootwarden sluice-gate two miles west of Thornwick. Spiral basalt stairs lead three hundred feet below the White Salt Wastes into a cavern held open by petrified world-tree roots."
    narrator "Saat fajar menyingsing, Vespera membuka pintu air Penjaga Akar yang tertutup rimbun semak, sekitar tiga kilometer di barat Thornwick. Tangga melingkar dari batu basal membentang seratus meter ke bawah Padang Garam Putih menuju gua purba yang disangga akar-akar raksasa pohon dunia yang telah membatu."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:27
translate indonesian chapter3_start_1fc319cb:

    # bram "Keep close to my lantern, folks. My left horn's buzzing like a tuning fork—there's old Resonance pooled down in the nave."
    bram "Jangan jauh-jauh dari lenteraku, kawan-kawan. Patahan tanduk kiriku berdengung kencang kayak garpu tala—ada endapan Resonansi purba tergenang di lorong depan."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:28
translate indonesian chapter3_start_d6e67413:

    # sera "Look at these walls... That's pre-Concordat architecture. The Choir told me nothing survived down here."
    sera "Lihat dinding-dinding ini... Ini arsitektur kuno sebelum era Konkordat. Paduan Suara bilang tak ada apa pun yang tersisa di bawah sini."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:29
translate indonesian chapter3_start_3b24ed65:

    # vespera "The Choir tells Outworlders lots of bedtime stories, Envoy. Let's split the chamber search—the Calibration Vault is just beyond the central archway."
    vespera "Paduan Suara itu banyak ngarang dongeng pengantar tidur buat anak-anak pendatang, Utusan. Ayo kita bagi pencarian—Ruang Kalibrasi tepat di balik lengkungan utama itu."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:115
translate indonesian ch3_scene_pedestals_01fdc079:

    # narrator "My flashlight—well, Vespera's brass lantern—sweeps behind the fourth salt-crusted statue. Scratched frantically into the slate with a belt buckle are words in messy, unmistakable English:"
    narrator "Senterku—yah, lenteranya Vespera—menyorot ke balik patung keempat yang berkerak garam tebal. Diukir tergesa-gesa pada batu sabak memakai gesper ikat pinggang, ada tulisan tangan dalam bahasa Inggris yang berantakan tapi sangat jelas:"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:116
translate indonesian ch3_scene_pedestals_62eec143:

    # narrator "{i}'MY NAME IS DANIEL CHO. TACOMA, WA. IF ANOTHER ONE OF US GETS PULLED HERE—DO NOT DRINK THE CRUCIBLE. I KILLED THE THIRD CALAMITY TODAY AND SAW A WRISTWATCH FUSED INSIDE ITS RIBS.'{/i}"
    narrator "{i}'NAMAKU DANIEL CHO. TACOMA, WA. KALAU ADA LAGI ANAK BUMI YANG TERSERET KE SINI—JANGAN PERNAH MINUM DARI KAWAH MAHKOTA. HARI INI AKU MEMBUNUH BENCANA KETIGA DAN MELIHAT JAM TANGAN MELEBUR DI TULANG RUSUKNYA.'{/i}"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:117
translate indonesian ch3_scene_pedestals_c3c248f8:

    # narrator "{i}'THERE ARE NO DEMON KINGS. IT'S JUST US AFTER WE FORGET HOME.'{/i}"
    narrator "{i}'TIDAK PERNAH ADA RAJA IBLIS. MEREKA SEMUA ADALAH KITA SENDIRI SETELAH KITA MELUPAKAN RUMAH.'{/i}"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:124
translate indonesian ch3_scene_pedestals_111d0da5:

    # sera "...A wristwatch. No. The Choir hymns say the Hollow Sovereigns crawl up from the Abyss—"
    sera "...Jam tangan. Nggak mungkin... Himne Paduan Suara bilang para Penguasa Hampa merayap naik dari Jurang Terkutuk—"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:125
translate indonesian ch3_scene_pedestals_725679be:

    # leo "Every Hero burned their memories until nothing was left except power looking for a fight... and then Aurelia summoned the {i}next{/i} lonely kid from Earth to put them down."
    leo "Setiap Pahlawan membakar habis ingatan mereka sampai nggak ada lagi yang tersisa selain kekuatan haus darah... lalu Aurelia memanggil anak kesepian {i}berikutnya{/i} dari Bumi untuk membantai mereka."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:126
translate indonesian ch3_scene_pedestals_98eb1779:

    # narrator "Seraphina backs against a petrified root, hand over her mouth. Neither of us speaks for a long moment."
    narrator "Seraphina mundur bersandar ke akar pohon yang membatu, kedua tangannya membekap mulutnya. Kami berdua terdiam dalam keheningan yang panjang dan menyesakkan."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:140
translate indonesian ch3_scene_campfire_a3b7b2a2:

    # bram "Nobody fights ancient salt-ghosts on an empty stomach! Drink up, stretch your calves, and check your copper leads!"
    bram "Nggak ada yang boleh tempur lawan arwah garam purba dengan perut kosong! Minum ini, regangkan otot kaki kalian, dan periksa sambungan kawat tembaganya!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:145
translate indonesian ch3_scene_campfire_1a15dd2a:

    # vespera "Hey, Sato. Whatever we find behind that vault door... when this is over, you're going back through that puddle with all your memories intact. Broker's guarantee."
    vespera "Hei, Sato. Apa pun yang kita hadapi di balik pintu ruang kubah itu... pas semua ini selesai, kau bakal pulang lewat genangan air itu dengan seluruh ingatanmu tetap utuh. Ini janji seorang pialang."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:150
translate indonesian ch3_scene_campfire_587b7912:

    # sera "...Your friend's garlic ration is absurdly salty. Give me half another piece. And don't die in the next room, cubicle guy."
    sera "...Ransum bawang putih temanmu ini asinnya kelewatan. Bagi setengah potong lagi dong. Dan awas jangan mati di ruangan sebelah, cowok kantoran."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:153
translate indonesian ch3_scene_campfire_5c86fd20:

    # bram "Listen here, Leo: you're still shaped like a shrimp, {i}but{/i} you're the toughest shrimp I've ever shared a shieldwall with! Let's bring that plate back to Orin!"
    bram "Dengar sini, Leo: tubuhmu memang masih cungkring kayak udang, {i}tapi{/i} kau udang paling tangguh yang pernah berdiri satu barisan perisai denganku! Ayo kita bawa pelat itu kembali ke Orin!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:167
translate indonesian ch3_scene_alcove_76e7bb57:

    # narrator "Tucked inside a hollow taproot is a rusted tin biscuit box from seventeenth-century London—wrapped in Rootwarden copper mesh that kept the salt away for four centuries."
    narrator "Terselip di dalam rongga akar tunjang, ada kaleng biskuit seng berkarat buatan London abad ketujuh belas—terbungkus anyaman kawat tembaga Penjaga Akar yang melindunginya dari gerusan garam selama empat abad."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:168
translate indonesian ch3_scene_alcove_d327ef6c:

    # narrator "Inside rests a humming salt-glass prism, schematic notes for a {b}Twin-Root Harmonic Bypass{/b}, and the final mica-pressed three-leaf clover!"
    narrator "Di dalamnya terbaring prisma kaca-garam yang berdengung hangat, sketsa rancangan untuk {b}Pintas Harmonik Dua-Akar{/b}, dan relik semanggi berdaun tiga kering terakhir dalam segel kaca mika!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:176
translate indonesian ch3_scene_alcove_61d47bc8:

    # thought "'Root Three: A hero is just a bridge until regular folks can cross on their own. Plant something green and go home.' — E. Marrow, 1689."
    thought "'Akar Tiga: Pahlawan itu cuma jembatan sementara sampai orang-orang biasa bisa menyeberang sendiri. Tanamlah sesuatu yang hijau di tanah, lalu pulanglah ke rumah.' — E. Marrow, 1689."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:197
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_a437cc2c:

    # narrator "Before the bronze Calibration Plate rises a nine-foot figure of fractured white salt-armor. Weeping violet starlight spills through its cracked visor as a broken halberd scrapes across the flagstones."
    narrator "Di depan Pelat Kalibrasi perunggu, bangkit sesosok raksasa setinggi tiga meter berbaju zirah garam putih yang retak. Cahaya bintang violet menetes pedih dari celah helmnya selagi ujung tombak besarnya berderit menyeret lantai batu."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:198
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_e7680d44:

    # remnant "...WHO... CALLS... FOR... DELIVERANCE...?"
    remnant "...SIAPA... YANG... MEMANGGIL... PENYELAMATAN...?"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:201
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_952dbf45:

    # leo "Wait—don't blast it! Look at the tarnished buckle under the crystal—that's Daniel Cho! The Fourth Paragon!"
    leo "Tunggu—jangan diserang dulu! Lihat gesper kusam di balik kristal itu—itu Daniel Cho! Paragon Keempat!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:203
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_f934c21c:

    # vespera "Watch out! That's a calcified Paragon husk—centuries of burned Resonance locked on autopilot! Ready stances!"
    vespera "Awas! Itu cangkang Paragon yang membatu—ingatan ratusan tahun yang terbakar dan cuma bergerak secara otomatis! Pasang kuda-kuda!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:220
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_370ab59a:

    # leo "Daniel! Daniel Cho from Tacoma! The fight's over—nobody's asking you to carry the sky anymore!"
    leo "Daniel! Daniel Cho dari Tacoma! Perangnya sudah selesai—nggak ada lagi orang yang nuntut kau memikul langit sendirian!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:221
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_04178b97:

    # narrator "The giant halberd freezes an inch above Bram's dented shield."
    narrator "Tombak raksasa itu membeku tepat dua sentimeter di atas perisai penyok Bram."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:222
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_922dbd28:

    # remnant "...Tacoma...? Rain... on... cedar...?"
    remnant "...Tacoma...? Hujan... di atas... pohon cemara...?"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:223
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_fb86fd61:

    # narrator "Instead of exploding into lethal salt, the crystalline armor sighs—crumbling into soft, dark, living loam across the cavern floor as a single pale green shoot uncurls between the stones."
    narrator "Bukannya meledak menjadi serpihan garam mematikan, zirah kristal itu menghela napas panjang—lalu runtuh menjadi hamparan tanah gembur hitam yang subur di lantai gua, bersamaan dengan sehelai tunas hijau muda yang merekah di sela bebatuan."

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:233
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_16281937:

    # narrator "With Bram locking the halberd shaft against his tower shield, I drive Orin's copper spade straight through the breastplate's central fissure—conducting four centuries of trapped static harmlessly into the cavern floor!"
    narrator "Dengan Bram yang mengunci gagang tombak pada perisai menaranya, kuhunjamkan sekop tembaga Kakek Orin tepat menembus celah tengah zirah dada—mengalirkan sisa arus statis empat abad dengan aman ke lantai gua!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:234
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_6e2dec9d:

    # narrator "As the empty salt-helm clatters onto the stone, a faint whisper exhales: {i}'...Thank you...'{/i}"
    narrator "Saat helm garam kosong itu terjatuh berdenting di lantai batu, terdengar bisikan samar: {i}'...Terima kasih...'{/i}"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:243
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_ecca08df:

    # narrator "Vespera wrenches the heavy bronze **First-Era Calibration Plate** free from the altar—just as the entire cavern ceiling shudders violently, showering white dust down the stairs!"
    narrator "Vespera mencabut **Pelat Kalibrasi Era Pertama** dari perunggu berat itu dari altar—tepat saat seluruh langit-langit gua bergetar hebat, menghujani tangga dengan runtuhan debu putih!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:247
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_cfaa80f0:

    # bram "Uh-oh. My horn just rang like a church bell! That wasn't down here—that was {i}up top{/i}!"
    bram "Gawat. Patahan tandukku berdenging kayak lonceng gereja! Guncangan barusan bukan dari bawah sini—tapi dari {i}atas{/i}!"

# game/story/chapter3.rpy:248
translate indonesian ch3_remnant_duel_d385708d:

    # vespera "The northern sky! The Sixth Seal didn't wait for sunset—Cassian's Ascending the Crucible Spire RIGHT NOW! Move!"
    vespera "Lihat langit utara! Segel Keenam nggak nunggu sampai matahari terbenam—Cassian sudah mulai mendaki Menara Kawah SEKARANG JUGA! Cepat lari!"
